WEBVTT

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.630
Turn right here,

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.630
koko wo migi

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.000
next take a left

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.000
sugi hidari

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.560
I'm getting nowhere, and don't know what to do!

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.560
mou nicchi mo sacchi mo ikanakutte komaru

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.860
Right, left

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.860
migi hidari

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.500
Reft, light

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.500
higi midari

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.080
Don't let your limbs outside the bus window!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.080
basu no mado kara te ya ashi wo dasu na

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.040
Take a left there,

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.040
soko hidari

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.440
then go right

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.440
sugu migi he

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.290
No matter which way I head, it's all the same

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.290
mou docchi ga docchi demo kekkyoku onaji

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.030
Sunny but cloudy later in the day,

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.030
hare nochi kumori tokoro ni yori

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:44.420
Raining in some places, it's like this, right?

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:44.420
tokidoki ame mitai na koto dayo ne

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.220
After making all these detours,

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.220
yorimichi bakari 

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:50.100
before I even realized what's happening

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:50.100
shitetara itsuno manika

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.550
The day is ending

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.550
hi ga kureteru

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:52.880
The year is also ending

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:52.880
toshi mo kureteru

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.560
And I'm at my wits' end!

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.560
tohou ni kure chatteru

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.310
Since my stomach's growling, let's go back

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.310
onaka ga naku kara kaerou

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:01.410
Let's go straight home

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:01.410
massugu ouchi he kaerou

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.280
When my soul is lost,

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.280
kokoro ga mayou toki wa

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.570
that smile is my guide!

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.570
sono egao ga mejirushi

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:09.460
Let's hold hands and go home

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:09.460
te to te wo tsunaide kaerou

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:12.240
Let's go home together

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:12.240
issho ni ouchi he kaerou

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.540
Always being there,

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.540
itsu datte soko ni ite

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:17.710
you always find me

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:17.710
mitsukete kureru anata

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.290
Even if it's a roundabout route,

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.290
toomawari demo

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:22.810
it's not the long way home!

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:22.810
toomawari janai

