00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.530
<i>A recurring horror.</i>

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:55.080
<i>Sand, seemingly with a will of its own.</i>

00:05:56.020 --> 00:06:01.040
Well, that said, the assumption would be
that someone's pulling a prank.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.070
It's nothing but sand.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:20.460
<i>I thought I might get a reaction
if I played in the sandbox like a child.</i>

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:26.340
Even if it's a prank, it's not something to be encouraged,

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:31.840
but that's not something I should
get involved with, or intervene in.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:36.100
Even if it's an apparition, it's not something you can just interact with.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:39.060
If it's something a human's doing, even more so.

