00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:46.630
HANEKAWA TSUBASA

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:43.380
<i>Oh, Araragi-kun?</i>

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.540
<i>There's something on my mind.</i>

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.610
<i>Do you have a moment?</i>

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.130
Yeah, that's fine.

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:53.030
<i>I got my routine report from Senjougahara-san a few moments ago.</i>

