00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:06.840
you were planning to investigate the sand in a certain park.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:09.490
Did you finish already?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:13.570
I intended to call when you were done investigating.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:16.200
Shame!

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:18.450
